      "writtenOn": "2024-08-08T20:56:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question, this is because this method is used to communicate with the remote device, not Android MediaSessions. Remote device doesn\u0027t have \"active\" players. Before this and before the browsing player refactor, AVRCP was broadcasting only one player: the - fake - \"Bluetooth Player\" which had subfolders as the real players.\nNow that we don\u0027t do this anymore, SetAddressedPlayer can actually be useful and thus we return the real addressed player.",
      "parentUuid": "6eb34871_57e1dd3d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 332,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "7f4d35d234053358b9f3711dd7216e6b81b1cd70",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4f5c65f3_b42cb8d0",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/audio_util/MediaPlayerList.java",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 376,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-08T20:32:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Change in this function are only managed by browsingRefactor flag and not setaddress. Is this expected ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 376,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 376,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "7f4d35d234053358b9f3711dd7216e6b81b1cd70",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b72f7f6_e357e634",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/audio_util/MediaPlayerList.java",
